Subject: [PATCH] feat(aot): add typed identity export metadata (AI-assisted)

Add the strict NativeExport1 identity contract and paired artifact generation while preserving the existing false-func Export0 path. Cover exact metadata, cross-ABI rejection, and recoverable publication failures.
